<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Valspar raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Valspar raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch analyst Karen Lane Gilsenen said she raised her rating on Valspar Corp to near-term accumulate from neutral and kept her long-term rating at buy.</p>
<p>-- She said the company had accelerating earnings growth, was a beneficiary of lower petrochemical costs, was going through an acquisition which should be accretive to earnings and was recession resistant.</p>
</text>
